# One line-ending convention for every platform: LF in the repository.
# Windows checkouts still work — this only pins what Git stores and what a
# checkout produces, so a contributor on macOS/Linux and one on Windows see the
# same bytes and a diff never turns into a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets, never normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
